# Selects Riedquat on the short-range chart, launches, jumps there, and fights the pirates who come for
# an anarchy's visitors: one is destroyed. The fight was played by a scratch steering program that read
# the targets' positions as it went; what it pressed is recorded here like any other replay.
wait 3
key space; wait 4
key F6; wait 1
down Left; wait 0.55; up Left; wait 0.05 # the cursor to Riedquat, 6.8 light years: six frames of the short-range chart (D18)
key F1; wait 8
digest launched 08b67520652138ab0e03595c5c1f3878daf41e39de2397e7bd379b55ce79efe5
down h; wait 0.2; up h                   # hyperspace: the countdown, then the jump
wait 6
digest arrived 36a793715104471ab935722ed83ed1ed615ce295ba18d795237632b6dcadb6e3
wait 34
digest pirates b08717c30beb97a921871f52bb5261ac29309ba8f1e87a935d620d1130f77767
